	(text "ADD-ON 2026-10-30 (DNP-able, add-only): Pi PWM audio line-out\nJ301 pin 12 (GPIO18, PWM0) -> 1k / 10n low-pass (fc ~16 kHz) -> 1u DC block -> J302. config.txt: dtoverlay=audremap,pins_18_19\nSpeaker amp (TPA3118) runs on its OWN battery: J302 GND is the only link (audio reference, no supply current). Keep amp/battery off PGND and chassis metal."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
